This policy is reviewed and updated regularly to address evolving data broker practices and privacy regulations:

**Review Schedule**: Policy review occurs every {{REVIEW_FREQUENCY}} or following significant regulatory changes

**Stakeholder Input**: Reviews include input from legal, IT, and business stakeholders

**Communication**: Policy updates are communicated to all affected personnel within 30 days of approval

**Version Control**: All policy versions are maintained with change logs and effective dates

**Next Review Date**: {{NEXT_REVIEW_DATE}}

Policy Effective Date: {{EFFECTIVE_DATE}}
Approved By: {{APPROVER_NAME}}, {{APPROVER_TITLE}}
